You are working in the hiyroscript/alva repository.

Alva is a framework-free browser fighting game built with HTML, CSS, ES modules, and Canvas 2D. There is no build step. Preserve the existing architecture, visual identity, accessibility behavior, settings persistence, splash animation, and menu flow.

Goal

Change Alva’s startup flow so that the first-run language selection dialog appears only after the complete splash sequence has finished.

The current implementation does this:

First launch → Language dialog → Splash → Home

Change it to:

First launch → Splash → Language dialog → Home

For a returning player who has already selected a language:

Returning launch → Splash → Home

The language chooser must never appear before or on top of the splash animation.

