* final black hold;
* reduced-motion equivalents.

Do not overlap the modal with the final splash artwork or fade.

When the dialog opens, the splash screen may remain the current underlying screen in its cleared/black state until the choice is made. That is preferable to navigating to Home underneath the dialog.

Do not show Home and then place the language dialog on top of it.

