Acceptance criteria

The work is complete when all of the following are true:

1. Clearing Alva’s saved settings and loading the game shows the splash first.
2. No language modal is visible during any part of the splash.
3. After the splash fully ends, the screen is black and the language modal appears.
4. Home has not been entered or visibly rendered behind the language modal.
5. Choosing English opens Home in English.
6. Choosing Français opens Home in French.
7. The choice persists through the existing Settings store.
8. Reloading after a choice shows splash → Home with no first-run chooser.
9. Returning French users see splash → French Home.
10. Browser language only changes which first-run option initially has focus.
11. Back cannot dismiss the mandatory first-run chooser.
12. Changing language later through Settings still works.
13. Reduced-motion splash follows the same order.
14. A failed splash load still continues to the language chooser for a new player.
15. A failed splash load continues directly to Home for a returning player.
16. Splash completion cannot trigger Home twice.
17. Cancelled/stale splash runs cannot open the chooser or navigate Home.
18. Back navigation from Home never returns to splash/language onboarding.
19. README/spec/source comments describe the new sequence.
